{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a55a6961-1159-888d-894e-5df69e6c3c40",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T17:56:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:54:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. This is Alan Almy. I realize it's almost six and City Hall is closed, so I'm glad somebody picked up the storm line. Is this the, um, water department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:54:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This is Public Works, but that's all right. How can I help you, Mr. Almy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, my apologies, I had the wrong department. I'm calling about snow. We only got a dusting today, but it's been bitterly cold all week and it's icing over. I'm at 45 Ayrault Street, on Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:55:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 45 Ayrault Street. And what's the concern with the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a dead-end, and as I understand it, a dead-end street is always plowed last. I have it written down here. I'm not asking to be moved up. But with this freeze, could someone put sand down? The slope by my entrance gets slick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:55:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So you'd like sand on Ayrault Street near number 45, because of ice from the cold snap. Do I have that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Near the entrance of my business, at 45."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in for the crew tonight. Do you want me to take a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:55:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:56:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157. Got it. They'll get to it when they can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T17:56:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodnight."
    }
  ],
